<!--tz-meta {"id":"ex-stats","title":"Stats — Terminal Readout","category":"Elixir","file":"elixir/stats.heex","tags":["heex","phoenix","stats","terminal","dark"],"description":"A machine reporting on itself: Latch's numbers as phosphor-green terminal readouts after a typed command, amber warnings included.","dnas":["retro-terminal"]} -->
<%!-- def stats(assigns) — attr :command, :string, default: "latch --report --all" · attr :stats, :list — each: %{label: string, value: string, note: string, warn: boolean} --%>
<%!--
Design read: A machine reporting on itself — Latch's numbers as phosphor-green terminal readouts after a typed command, with amber warnings on the figures that deserve a second look.
Distinctive choice: the blinking block cursor and amber "WARN" flags, plus scanlines baked into the panel like a real CRT.
Dials: VARIANCE 4 / MOTION 6 / DENSITY 7. DNA: retro-terminal (IBM Plex Mono / IBM Plex Mono / IBM Plex Mono).
--%>
<style>
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap");
.tz-term {
  --tz-bg: #0b0f0a;
  --tz-surface: #0e140d;
  --tz-ink: #33ff66;
  --tz-muted: #1f6b3a;
  --tz-accent: #ffb000;
  --tz-line: #33ff6633;
  --tz-font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "SFMono-Regular", monospace;
  background: var(--tz-bg);
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
}
.tz-term__inner { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
.tz-term__panel {
  background: var(--tz-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(51, 255, 102, 0.07);
}
.tz-term__panel::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    rgba(51, 255, 102, 0.045) 0px,
    rgba(51, 255, 102, 0.045) 1px,
    transparent 1px,
    transparent 4px
  );
}
.tz-term__bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
.tz-term__dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--tz-muted); }
.tz-term__dot--on { background: var(--tz-ink); border-color: var(--tz-ink); }
.tz-term__body { padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
.tz-term__cmd { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
.tz-term__cmd .tz-term__prompt { color: var(--tz-accent); font-weight: 600; }
.tz-term__cursor {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 0.62em;
  height: 1.15em;
  background: var(--tz-ink);
  vertical-align: text-bottom;
  margin-left: 2px;
  animation: tz-term-blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
}
@keyframes tz-term-blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
.tz-term__ok { color: var(--tz-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0 0 1.75rem; }
.tz-term__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--tz-line);
  border: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
}
.tz-term__stat { background: var(--tz-surface); padding: 1.6rem 1.5rem; }
.tz-term__label {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
  margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
}
.tz-term__value {
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(51, 255, 102, 0.35);
  animation: tz-term-in 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
}
.tz-term__note { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--tz-muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }
.tz-term__warn {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: var(--tz-bg);
  background: var(--tz-accent);
  padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
  margin-left: 0.6rem;
  vertical-align: middle;
  text-shadow: none;
}
@keyframes tz-term-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.tz-term__foot { margin-top: 1.75rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--tz-muted); }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .tz-term__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .tz-term__cursor { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
  .tz-term__value { animation: none; }
}
</style>
<section class="tz-term" aria-label="Latch by the numbers">
  <div class="tz-term__inner">
    <div class="tz-term__panel">
      <div class="tz-term__bar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="tz-term__dot tz-term__dot--on"></span>
        <span class="tz-term__dot"></span>
        <span class="tz-term__dot"></span>
        <span style="margin-left: auto">latch — zsh — 80×24</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tz-term__body">
        <p class="tz-term__cmd"><span class="tz-term__prompt">latch@hq:~$</span> {@command}<span class="tz-term__cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
        <p class="tz-term__ok">OK — report compiled in 0.04s, no invoices were harmed</p>
        <dl class="tz-term__grid">
          {for {s, i} <- Enum.with_index(@stats) do}
            <div class="tz-term__stat">
              <dt class="tz-term__label">{s.label}</dt>
              <dd class="tz-term__value" style={"animation-delay: " <> to_string(i * 0.12) <> "s"}>
                {s.value}{if s.warn do}<span class="tz-term__warn">WARN</span>{/if}
              </dd>
              <dd class="tz-term__note">{s.note}</dd>
            </div>
          {/for}
        </dl>
        <p class="tz-term__foot">tip: run <span style="color: var(--tz-ink)">latch --nudge --polite</span> before your morning coffee</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
